Description: SAML federation metadata registry and attribute-release policy manager
 Jagger manages SAML federation metadata, attribute-release ("ARP") policy,
 and a GUI for the Shibboleth SAML Identity Provider. It can synchronize
 metadata from another federation, run a single circle of trust, and sign
 MDQ metadata.
 .
 This package installs Jagger under /opt/jagger, provisions a dedicated
 least-privilege 'jagger' system user, and installs systemd units for its
 PHP-FPM pool and background workers. See /opt/jagger/docs/ (README.md,
 UPGRADE.md, TROUBLESHOOTING.md, UNINSTALL.md) after install for the
 remaining manual steps (TLS certificate, MySQL database, Apache vhost
 enable) that a package cannot safely automate for you.
